Face models

This software uses two models from the OpenCV Model Zoo
(https://github.com/opencv/opencv_zoo). Neither is distributed here. Both are
downloaded on first use and verified against a SHA-256 pinned in
src/headshots/models.py; a download that does not match is discarded.

  YuNet face detection - face_detection_yunet_2023mar.onnx
  MIT License. Copyright (c) 2020 Shiqi Yu <shiqi.yu@gmail.com>
  https://github.com/opencv/opencv_zoo/tree/main/models/face_detection_yunet

  SFace face recognition - face_recognition_sface_2021dec.onnx
  Apache License, Version 2.0.
  https://github.com/opencv/opencv_zoo/tree/main/models/face_recognition_sface

Both licences permit commercial use and redistribution. The training data behind
the SFace weights is not fully documented upstream; if that matters for your use,
follow opencv/opencv_zoo#313 before relying on it.
